'''Clovis' private residence''' was [[Rush Clovis]]'s residence on [[Scipio]]. [[Padmé Amidala Naberrie|Padmé Amidala]] and [[Anakin Skywalker]] met him there to help in uncovering corruption at the [[InterGalactic Banking Clan]], only to find the [[bounty hunter]] [[Embo]] and his [[anooba]] [[Marrok (anooba)|Marrok]] lying in wait.<ref name="AOF" />

